WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:07.330
Whatever your role, you have customers: people who use monday.com, and your colleagues and employees.

00:00:07.860 --> 00:00:09.470
They all have a lot to say.

00:00:10.220 --> 00:00:11.810
Usually more than you can read.

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:17.430
And now AI can read all of it in minutes: calls, tickets and surveys.

00:00:17.740 --> 00:00:19.770
But it gives you a confident summary.

00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:24.030
It may come from one loud voice, or say nothing you can act on.

00:00:24.620 --> 00:00:26.390
It's like a forecast that says:

00:00:26.730 --> 00:00:28.740
tomorrow, there will be weather.

00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:32.240
That's why you start from the question you need answered.

00:00:32.910 --> 00:00:36.200
Then you check that every point comes from several real people.

00:00:36.830 --> 00:00:39.400
And you look at who says it, and when it started.

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.220
If AI suggests a reason, you test it before you act.

00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:49.700
So in this adventure, you answer one real question from your feedback, and finish with concrete actions.

00:00:50.190 --> 00:00:51.880
Each owned by someone who said:

00:00:52.490 --> 00:00:53.120
I'll do it.
